## Components not covered

Electron, Chromium, Node.js, `electron-updater` and its dependencies, Ollama,
Piper and the voice you install for it, the models you run, and the services the
optional network features contact are covered by
[THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md) and their own licences, not by
this one. Some of those are stricter than this licence is — Piper's engine is
GPL-3.0 and its voices vary per voice — so if you ship something built on this,
read that file rather than assuming MIT covers the whole install.
